      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero-eyebrow"
          },
          "html": "Caresse vs Bloom Stories · Catalogue or generation"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h1",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "A Bloom Stories alternative,<br><em>created around you.</em>"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "Bloom offers stories and audio guides, including couple experiences and several languages. Caresse takes a different approach: sessions generated around your names and preferences, with no subscription. Download the app and hear free demos before generating a session with credits."
        },
        {
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "cta-group"
          },
          "html": "\n            <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/caresse/id6758887086?l=en-US\" id=\"hero-cta\" class=\"cta-pink\" data-store-auto data-cta-position=\"hero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download the app free</a>\n        "
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero-badge"
          },
          "html": "Anonymous mode · No Caresse sign-up · Free demos<br>Paid personalized sessions, no subscription."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "tldr"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "In one sentence"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "The honest summary."
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "tldr-card"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "<strong>Bloom Stories</strong> offers a catalogue made by writers, voice actors and production teams, including stories and guides for solo or shared listening. <strong>Caresse</strong> generates personalised guided fiction with a synthetic voice. Both offer French and Spanish as well as English: the choice is mainly about human or generative creation, personalisation and pricing."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "verdict",
        "id": "verdict"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "At a glance"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Caresse vs Bloom Stories: 9 useful criteria."
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "verdict-table-wrap",
            "tabindex": "0",
            "role": "region",
            "aria-label": "Caresse vs Bloom Stories: 9 useful criteria."
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "table",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "verdict-table"
              },
              "html": "\n                <thead>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th scope=\"col\" class=\"crit\">Criterion</th>\n                        <th scope=\"col\">Caresse</th>\n                        <th scope=\"col\">Bloom Stories</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Try before paying</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\">Free in-app demos, no Caresse account</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Public samples; selected free audio with an account</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Account requirements</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\">Guest mode; Apple or Google account required for purchases</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Account for the free selection and Premium</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Format</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\">Guided audio fiction, generated on demand</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Stories, roleplays, guides, audiobooks and relaxation</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Voices</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\">Synthetic voice</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Human voice actors, according to the provider</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Your names in the audio</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\">In personalised sessions, not in demos</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Generation using your names not advertised</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Personalisation</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\">Names, preferences, intensity and atmosphere</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Filters and content selection; no generation advertised</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Solo or couple</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\">Solo and duo modes</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Solo and couple stories and guides</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Audio languages</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\">French, English, Spanish and Portuguese (PT interface on Android; iOS update awaiting approval)</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">English, French, Spanish, German; catalogues vary by language</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Pricing model</th>\n                        <td class=\"caresse\">Credits to generate sessions; no subscription</td>\n                        <td class=\"other\">Limited free account; Premium subscription</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "cta-group",
            "style": "margin-top:32px"
          },
          "blocks": [
