                "class": "choose-card us"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Choose Caresse if you want…</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>an audio session built around your names and preferences</li>\n                    <li>a guided format, solo or as a couple</li>\n                    <li>demos without opening a Caresse account</li>\n                    <li>credits when you generate, instead of a subscription</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "choose-card them"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Choose Bloom Stories if you want…</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>stories written and performed by humans</li>\n                    <li>several formats, including couple guides</li>\n                    <li>to browse a catalogue instead of generating a session</li>\n                    <li>selected free audio with an account, then a subscription if you want the full catalogue</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "faq"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Frequently asked questions"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Caresse vs Bloom Stories: your questions."
        },
        {
          "type": "faq",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq-list"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Is there a free Bloom Stories alternative?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Caresse offers a free download and demos without a Caresse account; personalised sessions use paid credits. Bloom also offers public samples and selected free audios with an account. Neither provides its entire offering for free."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does Bloom Stories have French and Spanish audio?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes. Bloom advertises stories in English, French, Spanish and German. Catalogue availability varies by language; its Spanish page currently says it is not producing new Spanish stories. Caresse generates audio sessions in French, English, Spanish and Portuguese. The Portuguese interface is available on Android; the iOS update is awaiting approval. Free demos are in French, English and Spanish."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does Bloom Stories have guides for couples?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes. Bloom Guides include guided intimacy for solo exploration or couple experiences. Caresse differs through sessions generated around your names and preferences, not exclusive access to couple guidance."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does Bloom Stories use AI like Caresse?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Bloom advertises human-made stories and says it retired Bloom Chat, its former AI feature. Caresse uses AI to generate fiction and a synthetic voice to narrate it. These are different approaches with different strengths and limitations."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Are Caresse’s personalised sessions free?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "No. The download and audio demos are free. Generating a personalised session uses paid credits. Caresse does not require a subscription; the optional advanced-settings unlock is a separate purchase."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Do I need to create a Caresse account?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "No. You can use guest mode without creating a Caresse account. Purchases require your Apple or Google account with the relevant store. Guest mode does not make the transaction anonymous to the store."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
